-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data distributed with FANTASY (fantasy_agn/data) come from published work and
public archives; please cite their sources when you use them:

- Fe II templates: Kovačević, Popović & Dimitrijević (2010, ApJS 189, 15),
  Shapovalova et al. (2012, ApJS 202, 10) and Kovačević-Dojčinović & Popović
  (2015, ApJS 221, 35).
- Galaxy and quasar eigenspectra: Yip et al. (2004, AJ 128, 585 and 2603).
- Line wavelengths: NIST Atomic Spectra Database, Vanden Berk et al. (2001),
  Riffel et al. (2006) and Rodríguez-Ardila et al. (2011).
- Example spectra: the Sloan Digital Sky Survey (https://www.sdss.org).
The stellar templates downloaded on first use are those distributed with pPXF
(Cappellari); see the README for how to cite them.
